niViz (https://niviz.org/) is the reference implementation for the
scientific classifications, PRO interpretation, and display behavior.
niViz is licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later. Public source documentation
and a deployed library bundle were reviewed; niViz JavaScript is not
included in this project. See docs/upstream.md for pinned references.

