This project's implementation, dated 2026-09-24, reimplements the PRO
timeline/profile workflow in TypeScript with Canvas/SVG rendering,
independently drawn grain symbols, and standalone browser file controls.

The hosted demo uses the MST96 seasonal example output bundled with
SNOWPACK 3.7.0. SNOWPACK is licensed under LGPL-3.0-or-later; its
license and incorporated GPL text are retained in
docs/SNOWPACK-LICENSE.txt and docs/SNOWPACK-GPL-3.0.txt.

The niViz example at https://niviz.org/resources/example.pro is retained
as a test fixture. The niViz site identifies its content license as
CC BY 4.0; see docs/NIVIZ-SITE-CC-BY-4.0.txt.

Example data provenance is recorded in docs/upstream.md. The downloadable
standalone viewer does not embed example data or require a network
connection to open local files.
